  "notes": "Build workflow implemented 2026-10-22: targeted checks plus one serial local gate, CI incremental disabled, toolchain-aware cache keys, and semantic-candle split into a parallel matrix. Isolated MBX 1.26 trial: 25.35% warm P50 gain, but 5.28x physical target+store footprint and 23 path-sensitive verification divergences, so MBX remains opt-in only. Seven audited caches were safely recycled; trial store cleanup bypassed the Recycle Bin, so all further cleanup stopped. No source or evidence was affected; four trial worktrees remain for explicit follow-up. Local nextest trial verified fixed eight-thread nextest for opt-in package/full test modes; package tests passed 70/70 and the full gate passed 1978/1978 with 23 ignored and all doctests (P50 72.072s vs 101.562s, 29.04% faster; P95 73.414s vs 103.130s); default-thread nextest was disqualified by a WriterBusy failure. CI remains native pending a hosted experiment.",
